        "created_at": "2020-01-28T20:06:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>p214, damage, major, are both \"all heroes in the same location\" and \"all heroes in the scene\" bothn supposed to be mid, as written, or is scene supposed to be min.</p>\n<p>p215, top, twists,&nbsp; \"add a quantity of a threat equal to the Min die\" - in this context, what is a point of threat?&nbsp; This feels like a terminology/methodology change happened and a reference got missed.</p>\n<p>p215, twists, Add a challenge - not clear what level of challenge it should be.</p>\n<p>219, Rt, Top. creating lieutenants — \"Lieutenant minions should have[…]\" Is the minions there a copy-paste error?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:28.869Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
